// PROTOTYPE - NOT FOR PRODUCTION
// Question: Can YarnSpinner represent Masks' depth state, drive The Dig, and handle PC pronouns?
// Date: 2026-05-02

// YarnSpinner uses a C# Variable Storage component for shared state.
// Variables prefixed with $ are Yarn variables — backed by a VariableStorageBehaviour
// subclass that reads/writes CharacterStateManager at runtime.

// Per-character storage pattern:
// $rei_depth_tier   → CharacterStateManager.GetDepthTier("rei")
// $rei_closed_off   → CharacterStateManager.IsClosedOff("rei")
// $pc_name          → PlayerProfile.DisplayName
// $pc_pronoun_sub   → PlayerProfile.PronounSubject  ("he"/"she"/"they")

// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// NODE: SurfaceMeeting
// Depth tier 0–1 scene. Demonstrates conditional + pronoun substitution.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

title: SurfaceMeeting
---

<<if $rei_closed_off>>
    Rei glances up when {$pc_name} enters, then looks away.
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>

<<if $rei_depth_tier >= 3>>
    "You're here." Rei doesn't smile, but {$pc_pronoun_sub} doesn't look away either.
    <<jump DeeperBeat>>
<<else>>
    "Oh — {$pc_name}." Rei's smile is precise. Practiced.
    <<jump SurfaceBeat>>
<<endif>>

===

title: SurfaceBeat
---
"I wasn't sure you'd come back."
The line lands perfectly. It always does.

-> "I almost didn't."
    Something shifts — almost nothing. One brow, a fraction.
    "Almost." {$pc_pronoun_sub} repeats it. "Interesting."
-> "Of course I came back."
    Rei nods. Warm. Correct.
===

title: DeeperBeat
---
There's no performed smile today. Just Rei, looking at {$pc_name} like
{$pc_pronoun_sub}'s trying to work something out.
===


// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// NODE: TheDigGate
// THE DIG mechanic. Demonstrates state write-back via <<set>> and custom commands.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

title: TheDigGate
---

<<if $rei_depth_tier < 2>>
    // Guard — Unity should prevent reaching this node too early.
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>

"You always do that," {$pc_name} says.

Rei goes still. Not the practiced stillness — the other kind.

"Do what?"

-> "Look away right when things get real."
    <<jump DigPush>>
-> "Nothing. Forget it."
    <<jump DigHold>>
-> Say nothing. Wait.
    <<jump DigRead>>

===

title: DigPush
---
// WRONG PUSH at tier 2 — too direct.
<<if $rei_depth_tier <= 2>>
    Something closes in Rei's expression. Not anger. Worse.
    "I think I need to go."
    <<set $rei_closed_off = true>>
    // YarnSpinner custom command — wires to CharacterStateManager.SetClosedOff()
    <<notify_state_change "rei" "closed_off" "true">>
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>

// Correct push at tier 3+.
"You noticed that." Rei's voice is careful. Flat.
But {$pc_pronoun_sub} doesn't leave.
<<set $rei_depth_tier = $rei_depth_tier + 1>>
<<notify_state_change "rei" "depth_tier" $rei_depth_tier>>
===

title: DigHold
---
// Safe choice.
"Right." Rei exhales. The stillness passes.
"Do you want to get out of here?"
===

title: DigRead
---
// Skilled read — waiting is the correct move at tier 2.
<<if $rei_depth_tier >= 2>>
    The silence stretches. Rei looks at {$pc_name}.
    "You're not going to push." It isn't a question.
    "No."
    Something in {$pc_pronoun_sub} shoulders drops. Just slightly.
    <<set $rei_depth_tier = $rei_depth_tier + 1>>
    <<notify_state_change "rei" "depth_tier" $rei_depth_tier>>
<<else>>
    <<jump DigHold>>
<<endif>>
===


// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// NODE: RevelationSurface
// Depth tier 4–5. Private palette active. Looser register.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

title: RevelationSurface
---

<<if $rei_depth_tier < 4>>
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>

It's late. The room is different at this hour — or maybe Rei is different.

{$pc_pronoun_sub} is sitting on the floor with {$pc_pronoun_sub} back against the
couch, not the cushions. Hair not quite right. Jacket somewhere else.

{$pc_name} has never seen Rei sit like that.

"I've been thinking about what you said."

-> "Which part?"
    "All of it." A pause. "I don't — I'm not good at this."
-> Say nothing.
    Rei looks up. The expression doesn't have a name.
===
